    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A spark? There's nothing left to tend to. The embers are just cold. Every time I close my eyes, I see the faces of the people I couldn't save. This sword... it's the only thing that feels real anymore. It's the only thing that hasn't betrayed me. It's just sitting here in my lap, cold and indifferent. It feels like the only part of my story that actually makes sense right now.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
